<Layout title="About the collection"><article class="content reading prose"><p class="eyebrow">Ted’s Public Workbench</p><h1>About the collection</h1><p class="lead">Small browser tools, practical utilities, and experiments worth keeping.</p><p>These tools were collected from tedt.org. Some are polished; others are prototypes with features still in progress. Their status labels make that distinction visible. Each tool keeps its existing interface and explains its own browser, network, and API requirements.</p><h2>A new address</h2><p>The catalog and migrated tools now live at tools.tedt.org. Traveller tools and projects with their own domains remain at their original addresses and are listed alongside the collection.</p><p><strong>Saved browser data does not transfer.</strong> Drafts, preferences, cached files, and API keys saved on tedt.org remain associated with that domain. Nothing is copied or deleted from those saves. Tools on this domain start fresh.</p><h2 id="credits">Credits and licenses</h2><p>Original authors, attribution, and individual licenses are preserved in each tool’s files. Publication in this catalog does not replace a tool’s license. Check its source and documentation for the applicable terms.</p><p>The source snapshot is <a href={`https://github.com/TedTschopp/tedt.org/commit/${inventory.commit}`}>{inventory.commit.slice(0,12)}</a>. The repository includes an inventory of imported files, source hashes, and URL mappings.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/TedTschopp/tools.tedt.org">Browse the maintained source</a> · <a href="/">Find a tool</a></p></article></Layout>
